@startuml sequence-overview
!include theme.iuml
title teamscale-mcp — overview

skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
autonumber

actor "MCP client\n(Claude Code, …)" as Client
participant "teamscale-mcp\n(this repo)" as Sidecar
participant "Teamscale\nREST API" as TS

Client -> Sidecar : MCP tool call over HTTP\nX-Teamscale-User + X-Teamscale-Token
Sidecar -> TS : forwarded as\nAuthorization: Basic base64(user:token)
TS --> Sidecar : result (client's own permissions)
Sidecar --> Client : MCP tool result

note over Sidecar : Turns each Teamscale REST endpoint into an MCP tool.\nHolds no secret — the client's identity is the only credential.

@enduml
